			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:middle;width:2.7%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:middle;width:29.4%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">We have granted the Underwriter the Option to purchase up to [&#9679;] additional shares of Common Stock at the public offering price, less the underwriting discounts and commissions. The underwriters can exercise this right at any time within 45 days after the date of this prospectus.</p>
			</td>
