			<td style="vertical-align:middle;width:2.7%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:middle;width:29.4%;">&nbsp;</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:18.2%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Use of proceeds</b></p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:middle;width:2.7%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:middle;width:29.4%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">We intend to use the net proceeds from this Offering for working capital and general corporate purposes, including sales and marketing activities, product development and capital expenditures, as well as a portion of certain indebtedness of the Company. We may also use a portion of the net proceeds to acquire or invest in complementary businesses, products and technologies. See &#8220;<i>Use of Proceeds</i>&#8221;&nbsp;beginning on page S-[&#9679;] of this prospectus supplement for additional detail.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
