			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">the number of investors in general that will consider investing in our Common Stock;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 18pt;">&nbsp;</td>
